# Skullsnap Nuisance, Eerie: "Whenever an enchantment you control enters and whenever you fully unlock a Room, surveil 1."
# Turn 1: Skullsnap Nuisance is cast, then Ornithopter (an artifact creature entering: no surveil), then Unholy Annex //
# Ritual Chamber as its left door, Unholy Annex (an enchantment entering, only one door unlocked so not a full unlock): one
# surveil, and Bot1 puts the Island it sees into the graveyard (CR 701.25a). Unholy Annex then draws Mox Ruby at the end
# step. On turn 5 Ritual Chamber is unlocked, the Room's other door (CR 709.5i, fully unlocked, no enchantment entering):
# one more surveil, and Bot1 leaves the card it sees on top.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Skullsnap Nuisance
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
Island
Mox Ruby
Swamp
Mountain
Island
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

